\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 1- \highlight22\uc2 Nigeria \highlight\uc2  naira eases: c.bank  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2  no help\b0\par\par\uc2 219 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 26 Februar 2014\par 16:19\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2014 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 LAGOS, Feb 26 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Nigeria\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  with dollar sales to lift the naira on Wednesday but strong demand for the U.S. dollar outweighed the move.\par \par \uc2 Dealers said uncertainty about monetary policy following the suspension of \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governor Lamido Sanusi last week and reduction in foreign portfolio flows continued to weigh on the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which has lost 3.2 percent since this year.\par \par \uc2 The local unit touched a low of 165.80 naira during midday trade before the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to bring it back to Wednesday's close of 164.80 naira. It closed at 164.60 naira on Tuesday, down 0.12 percent on the day.\par \par \uc2 "\b \highlight22\uc2 Central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  ... slowed depreciation of the naira and provided support for the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," one dealer said.\par \par \uc2 The regulator has been \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  at interbank trades to prop up the naira over the past months, running down its depleting reserves to manage volatility in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Dealers said importers, who were among the heavy \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  users in Nigeria, were timing their dollar purchases to rhyme with \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight