\par\par \b \uc2 Nigerian naira up 1.6 pct vs dlr on cbank  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 249 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 17 Juni 2013\par 16:12\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2013 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 LAGOS, June 17 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Nigeria\b0 \highlight\uc2 's naira gained about 1.6 percent against the dollar on the interbank market on Monday, after the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  sold substantial dollar amounts to some banks to support the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , traders said.\par \par \uc2 The naira closed at 160.1 to the dollar on the interbank, its strongest in almost one week, from 162.7 to the dollar it closed at on Friday.\par \par \uc2 The Nigerian naira closed at its lowest level in almost a year on Friday, as offshore investors continued to sell off local bonds and dollar supply from oil companies was too weak.\par \par \uc2 "The naira recovery was aided by large dollar sales by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  directly to some banks toward the close of market today," one dealer said.\par \par \uc2 Traders said a unit of France's Total sold $7 million and Italian ENI $6 million in the market.\par \par \uc2 At the official bi-weekly \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  auction window, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  sold $300 million at 155.75 to the dollar, same amount and rate it sold at the previous auction on Wednesday.\par \par \uc2 Traders said demand for the dollar remained strong and hoped the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would be able to sustain its support for the naira.\par \par \uc2 "We see the naira edging back to its weak position unless the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  sustained its \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," another dealer said. (Reporting by Oludare Mayowa; Editing by Tim Cocks)\par \par \uc2 NIGERIA-NAIRA/ | AFN | ABN | M | D | DNP   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020130617e96h000r6\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw205\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3075\pichgoal600
