\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Nigeria \highlight\uc2  over budget on exchange  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2 . \b0\par\par\uc2 276 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 21 Juli 1997\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1997 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  LAGOS, July 21 (Reuter) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Nigeria\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Monday said it was over budget on sales of \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  for the first six months of 1997 and had sold about $1.6 billion out of a total $2.72 billion allocated for the year. \par \par \uc2  But in the face of falling demand from customers, despite an appreciating naira \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , bank officials said they believed the target amount need not be breached by the end of the year. \par \par \uc2  Demand, which is used by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to set the rate at which it sells \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2 , fell at last week's Thursday sale to $24.6 million from $36.5 million a week earlier. This was in spite of a strengthening of the naira to 83.5 to the dollar from 84 to the dollar the week before. \par \par \uc2  Bankers say that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's demonstrated intention of strengthening the naira over recent weeks has helped dampen demand, as they wait to see at what level the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  will be allowed to settle. \par \par \uc2  But they say the main reason for low demand is that business has been badly hit by recession. \par \par \uc2  The recession is blamed by manufacturers and importers on government's reluctance to spend proceeds of crude oil exports locally out of fear of inflation and of weakening the naira. \par \par \uc2  Apparent victory in the war on inflation and the stabilisation of the naira are seen by supporters of military ruler General Sani Abacha as the prizes of tight fiscal policies since he took power in the economic and political chaos after the annulment of 1993 elections. \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1997 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011002dt7l026fu\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
