\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Nigeria \highlight\uc2  moves to weekly  \highlight22\uc2 forex intervention \highlight\uc2 . \b0\par\par\uc2  By Matthew Tostevin \par \uc2 459 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 22 Mai 1996\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1996 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  LAGOS, May 22 (Reuter) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Nigeria\b0 \highlight\uc2  changed to weekly from monthly \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  on its \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets on Wednesday, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  of \b \highlight22\uc2 Nigeria\b0 \highlight\uc2  said the decision to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  weekly on the Autonomous \b \highlight22\uc2 Foreign Exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market points to \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  stability and could eventually strengthen the naira. \par \par \uc2  "It should remove speculative demand, and when there is no pressure to buy more than may be needed, it will further stabilise the naira," \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  spokesman Tony Ede told Reuters. \par \par \uc2  "Eventually we would like to see the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  appreciate." \par \par \uc2  A rate of 82.50 naira has been proposed to the 77 commercial and merchant banks bidding for foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has not revealed the amount it will sell. \par \par \uc2  But some bankers worried whether the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would be able to meet weekly requirements. \par \par \uc2  "If it removes speculative demand it removes unnecessarily inflated rates and also the need to borrow large sums of money monthly, so we save on the cost of borrowing," said one banker. \par \par \uc2  "But I am not convinced the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has the ability to fund the \b \highlight22\uc2 operation\b0 \highlight\uc2  on a weekly basis," he added. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is confident it can meet the demand. \par \par \uc2  "We felt it is not necessary to state the amount we are offering because we have been able to meet demand since last year on the monthly basis and we are sure we will be able to supply whatever is required," said Ede. \par \par \uc2  Over the past year the naira has attained a stability unprecedented in Nigeria's recent past, hovering around 80 to 85 naira to the dollar. \par \par \uc2  This has helped to bring down inflation. Some estimates for annual inflation have gone from above 80 percent a year ago to less than 50 percent now. \par \par \uc2  Many economic operators hope \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  eventually strengthens the naira, a declared aim of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  "We asked for more regular \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  but one would want to be sure that the amount on offer will be at least the same as it is now on the monthly basis," director-general of the Manuafacturers Association of Nigeria, Uzor Ekeke said. \par \par \uc2  "Most of our members are reliant on imports for the local market, exports are small, so if the naira strengthened it would definitely be good for us," he added. \par \par \uc2  Ede said he could not disclose the rate which the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had in mind as a target value for the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  "We are still going to follow the market," he said. \par \par \uc2  "I think it would be good to see the \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  eventually leading to a rate of around 60 naira to the dollar," said one banker. \par \par \uc2  --Lagos newsroom +234 1 2630317 \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1996 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011018ds5m07l1x\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
