\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Nigeria Central Bank \highlight\uc2  to  \highlight22\uc2 intervene \highlight\uc2  in  \highlight22\uc2 forex \highlight\uc2  market. \b0\par\par\uc2 232 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 16 November 1995\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1995 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  LAGOS, Nov 16 (Reuter) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Nigeria\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said it would \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  via auction in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market on Monday to shore up the naira \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  It said in a statement that $100 million would be offered for sale at a rate of 85 naira to the dollar, and it listed about 70 banks selected to participate in the periodic auction. \par \par \uc2  The naira fell on Thursday to its lowest level this year on fears the hanging of nine rights activists last week will lead to international economic pressure on the country, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the naira had fallen to between 90 and 92 to the dollar in the autonomous market compared to the 80-85 level where it had been trading for most of the year. \par \par \uc2  "The naira is responding to the situation in the country," said \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  bureau operator Taiye Abiodun. \par \par \uc2  Nigeria has come under international condemnation since last Friday when the nine members of the Movement for the Survival of Ogoni Peoples (MOSOP), including its president, writer Ken Saro-Wiwa, were hanged. \par \par \uc2  Dozens of ambassadors were swiftly recalled from Lagos  and economic sanctions against the country were being discussed by the European Union. \par \par \uc2  Monday's auction of \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  willl be the fourth by the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  this year. \par \par \uc2  --Lagos newsroom +234 1 2630317 \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1995 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011103drbg01m5c\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
