\par\par \b \uc2  Nigeria's  \highlight22\uc2 forex \highlight\uc2  decision seen ruining some banks. \b0\par\par\uc2  By Tunde Obadina \par \uc2 488 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 10 Februar 1995\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1995 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  LAGOS, Feb 10 (Reuter) - The \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  of Nigeria (CBN) said on Friday it would sell hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  directly to end users through selected banks when it \b \highlight22\uc2 intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  in \b \highlight22\uc2 Nigeria\b0 \highlight\uc2 's newly legalised autonomous \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market. \par \par \uc2  The CBN, issuing guidelines on mechanisms of a liberalised \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market announced by the government last month, said the selected banks may charge transaction fees and commissions. \par \par \uc2  Bankers in Lagos, Nigeria's financial hub, said the decision to use only some banks to sell scarce hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  was likely to lead to the collapse of some of the other banks. \par \par \uc2  "If they insist on selling \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  only through some banks we will surely see many bank failures this year," said a \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealer in one of the country's top three banks. \par \par \uc2  "There is going to be a massive movement of naira out of banks that don't qualify to sell government funds," he said. \par \par \uc2  Banks are anxious to be among those chosen by the CBN beause official funds, mainly oil export earnings, account for the bulk of money likely to be traded in the market. \par \par \uc2  "Right now every bank wants to know what criteria CBN will use to select the banks it will do business with," said a Lagos-based commercial banker. "There is going to be a mad rush to be one of the chosen ones." \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealing is the main source of profit for banks in Nigeria's import-dependent economy. \par \par \uc2  Bankers said the CBN may decide not to sell \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  through financially-distressed banks. \par \par \uc2  CBN officials say 36 out of Nigeria's 116 commercial and merchant banks are distressed but decline to name them. \par \par \uc2  Last year the CBN liquidated four banks because their financial situation were considered irreparable. \par \par \uc2  "The new \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  system will quicken the death of distressed banks," said a manager at a merchant bank. \par \par \uc2  The CBN said it would \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the autonomous \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  market when it deems necessary, "giving only short notice of such \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ". It said it would buy at the current autonomous selling rate in the market. \par \par \uc2  The dollar sold for as high as 82 naira on Friday compared to 78 naira on Monday. \par \par \uc2  Volume of transactions in the autonomous market remains small as people wait for the new system to show how it works and for the CBN to pump funds into the market. \par \par \uc2  All individuals, private sector operators and state-run companies operating on a commercial basis must now buy their \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  from the autonomous market. \par \par \uc2  The government still maintains an official exchange rate of 22 naira to the dollar but that rate applies only to certain government transactions. \par \par \uc2  Private sector groups have said the two-tier system is open to abuse as officials with access to subsidised hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  may be tempted to divert to the autonomous market. \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1995 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011104dr2a019sf\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
