\par\par \b \uc2  Nigeria's  \highlight22\uc2 forex \highlight\uc2  move may ruin some banks - bankers. \b0\par\par\uc2  By Tunde Obadina \par \uc2 378 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 10 Februar 1995\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1995 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  LAGOS, Feb 10 (Reuter) - The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's decision to sell scarce \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  to the public through selected banks is likely to lead to the collapse of some of Nigeria's banks who are not chosen, bankers said. \par \par \uc2  "If they insist on selling \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  only through some banks we will surely see many bank failures this year," said a \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealer in one of the country's top three banks. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  (CBN) said in guidelines issued on Friday that it would sell hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  directly to end users through selected banks when it \b \highlight22\uc2 intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the newly legalised autonomous \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market. \par \par \uc2  It said banks not chosen could still take part in the autonomous market which also gets funds from the private sector. \par \par \uc2  With official funds accounting for the bulk of money likely to be traded in the market, banks are anxious to be among those chosen by the CBN. \par \par \uc2  "Right now every bank wants to know what criteria CBN will use to select the banks it will do business with," said a Lagos-based commercial banker. "There is going to be a mad rush to be one of the chosen ones," he added. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealing is the main business of banks in this import-dependent economy. \par \par \uc2  "There is going to be a massive movement of naira out of banks that don't qualify to sell government funds," said the \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealer. \par \par \uc2  Bankers say the CBN may decide not to sell \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  through financially-distressed banks. \par \par \uc2  CBN officials say 36 out of Nigeria's 116 commercial and merchant banks are distressed but decline to name them. \par \par \uc2  Last year the CBN liquidated four banks because their financial situation were considered irreparable. \par \par \uc2  "The new \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  system will quicken the death of distressed banks," said a manager with a merchant bank. \par \par \uc2  The CBN guidelines, which had been anxiously awaited by banks, said \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the autonomous \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  market shall be "when considered necessary giving only short notice of such \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ." \par \par \uc2  "The \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  of \b \highlight22\uc2 Nigeria\b0 \highlight\uc2  shall sell \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  at the current autonomous selling rate in the market," it said. \par \par \uc2  --Lagos newsroom +234 1 2630317 \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1995 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011104dr2a019rx\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
